      "text": "Bolivia tour: Uyuni Salt Flats, Moon Valley, La Paz and Tiwanaku"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "44cc9ae26d491697444db541c7e00c78bf7c6241c555e9df330cac3b6f9f7e36",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-5d356bbaac960a07",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "This 7-day route takes you to La Paz, the archaeological site of Tiwanaku, Moon Valley, Lake Titicaca, Isla del Sol and the Uyuni Salt Flats. Ride the cable car above La Paz, visit the Witches’ Market and cross the Tiquina Strait. The trip also takes in the Train Cemetery, Colchani, Incahuasi Island, the Coquesa mummies and views of Tunupa Volcano."
